# Normalize line endings to LF for text files so future diffs reflect real
# content changes instead of CRLF/LF churn (several files in this repo had
# inconsistently mixed line endings before this). Doesn't retroactively
# rewrite already-committed files — only applies as files are touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
